    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience a true bullet hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge waves of bullets as the enemy automatically takes damage over time. Use different specialised characters to avoid damage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear boss progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Special modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of bullet patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, difficult to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple menus and UI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience a true bullet hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge waves of bullets as the enemy automatically takes damage over time. Use different specialised characters to avoid damage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear boss progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Special modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of bullet patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, difficult to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple menus and UI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A true bullet-hell game. Dodge an onslaught of bullets as a variety of ships while surviving until the boss is whittled down enough. Fight the main bosses in a linear order or play special gamemodes that go on forever.",
